    "body": "Normalizes Windows paths by converting backslashes to forward slashes. For example, ```C:\\folder\\file.txt``` becomes ```C:/folder/file.txt``` this needs to happen before entering file state since file state treats backslashes as validation errors, but here we're doing legitimate Windows path handling.",
